                {
                  "text": "Enkig 16.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore te nkolong oo lng'anayio le dukuya, ti ninchooyo iyie olasar le ntapa te nkaraki entapa ng'ejuk naishori Olaitoriani, te ilo sirua linyi loo wikii, ninturrurrorro aaibung eumata sinyati; nimiasiasa esiaai nagol, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake entarasai olasar opejori, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani: iloing'ok oare ooti, o lmeregesh obo, isitiman oopishana le kerra lo lari obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lasar le ntapa napuyiapui, naipurja te ilata, o matuan uni e tomon e efa to loing'oni ake obo, o matuan are e tomon e efa to lmeregesh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ematua nabo e tomon te pooki ake ninye sitima le ker le lelo oopishana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nebo o sitima obo le kine, pee eitobir osotua lo lning'o te nkaraki intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nebo ilo asar opejori le anaake, o lasar lenye le ntapa, ntarasai iyie ninche te nebo o ilo asar lenye ooki. Todua nchere meeta ninche entioto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
